{
"Items.RailAvenger.Desc": "This beautiful katana was said to be crafted by the gods themselves, at the beginning of time. Their chosen warrior fell to the demon menace, but they have found a new one to take up the Way of the Blade. Ordinary men cannot wield the true power of this blade."
"Items.RailAvenger.Long": "The Light Rail Avenger"
"Items.RailAvenger.Short": "Rail Avenger"
}
